  <h1>UpYou Support</h1>

  <p>
    Thank you for using UpYou. UpYou is a simple goals and challenges tracker designed to help you stay focused, build consistency, and monitor your progress.
  </p>

  <h2>Need Help?</h2>

  <p>
    If you have any questions, issues, feedback, or need support with the app, please contact us by email:
  </p>

  <p>
    <strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:nataliia.apps@gmail.com">nataliia.apps@gmail.com</a>
  </p>

  <p>
    We aim to respond as soon as possible.
  </p>

  <h2>Common Support Topics</h2>

  <p>You can contact us if you need help with:</p>

  <ul>
    <li>Creating or editing goals</li>
    <li>Creating or editing challenges</li>
    <li>Linking challenges to goals</li>
    <li>Tracking progress or streaks</li>
    <li>Managing subscriptions</li>
    <li>Reporting a bug or technical issue</li>
    <li>Sharing feedback or feature suggestions</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Subscriptions</h2>

  <p>
    UpYou subscriptions are managed through your Apple ID. To manage, cancel, or update your subscription, please open the Settings app on your iPhone, tap your Apple ID, then go to Subscriptions.
  </p>

